00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:39.030
Well, I bet it is when you're around.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:41.700
So I prefer being with you guys.

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:43.010
Hey, Kanji.

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:43.670
Huh?

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.610
Do you know Naoki Konishi?

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:47.780
Oh, Naoki? Sure I know him.

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:49.440
We're childhood friends.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:50.550
Eh?

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:52.210
Wha-?! For real?

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:54.120
So is he...

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:56.710
...Konishi's little brother, right?

00:10:56.990 --> 00:11:01.290
We hung out a bunch back in elementary school,

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:04.220
but we haven't talked much lately.

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:06.830
What's he like in class?

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:09.060
Is it true he's always being left out?

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:10.700
Dunno.

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:14.030
You don't?! But that's important!

00:11:14.100 --> 00:11:17.470
I don't know! We're in different classes.

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:20.000
Man, you're no help.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:23.870
What?! Tch, you're such a pain!

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:27.580
What? What's up?

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:28.950
Done already?

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:29.640
Persona!

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:31.350
Here he is.

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:32.650
What's the big deal?!

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:37.490
If you want to learn about him, ask him directly.

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:39.620
No, that's not the issue...

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:42.200
Eh? Wh-what is it?

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:43.760
Uh, well...

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.630
Are you being left out in class?

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:48.970
Hey, that's way too upfront!

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:53.240
It's the first time someone's
asked that straight to my face.

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:55.300
It's actually pleasant for a change.

00:11:56.880 --> 00:12:00.620
It's true. Honestly, I feel left out.

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:04.620
It's like everyone's staring at me
from a distance.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:06.820
They're always babying me.

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:09.020
Have you been skipping school a lot?

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:13.980
Yeah. I have to help my family
fend off the press and all.

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:17.100
I hear you. It's that way for me, too.

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:21.530
Lately the neighbors have been
coming to take shifts.

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:26.900
They tell me to live out life to the fullest
for my sister and start crying.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:29.110
It's suffocating.

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:32.570
It's yours if you want it.

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:35.150
Huh? A nikudon from Aiya?

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:37.550
You sure? That's my favorite!

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:39.920
Hey! Those're my seconds!

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:41.490
Buck up and deal, Kanji!

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:42.760
Be nice!

